 "transcript": [
  "[action] Wang Lung sits and smokes",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) the second son returns home",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"Well, and what is this I hear of a great grain market?\"",
  "[silence] Wang Lung says nothing.",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"And I am making it. I am going to build it in the old temple courtyard. I have bought the land from the good Lady of Heaven knows Who.\"",
  "[action] The second son smiles and leans against a pillar.",
  "the second son (to the eldest son): \"Well, and it is a good thing to do. Only the land in the temple is too good to build an ordinary grain market upon.\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"It is your house, and what do you wish?\"",
  "[action] The eldest son enters the house with his brother",
  "the eldest son (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and I do not know. But it is a small house and I do not wish to live in it after I have married. It is not fitting. I would like to have a house in the inner court. It is only reasonable.\"",
  "[says] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung agrees to his son's request",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and do what you like. It is your house.\"",
